# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Moss & Mail — PUBLIC repository. It serves mossandmail.com.
#  Anything committed here is readable at mossandmail.com/<filename>.
#
#  This is a WHITELIST. Everything is ignored by default.
#  Nothing can leak by accident. To publish a new website file,
#  add an explicit "!" line for it below — and only do that if the
#  file is genuinely meant to be public.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. Ignore everything at the top level
/*

# 2. Publish only these website files
!/.gitignore
!/CNAME
!/index.html
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/llms.txt

# 3. The images folder: allow the folder, then only real media inside it
!/images/
/images/*
!/images/*.jpg
!/images/*.jpeg
!/images/*.JPEG
!/images/*.JPG
!/images/*.png
!/images/*.PNG
!/images/*.webp
!/images/*.svg
!/images/*.ico
!/images/*.mp4
!/images/*.MP4

# 4. Never, under any circumstances
.github_token
KEYS.md
*.env
**/.DS_Store
